# My First AI - by Abraham Linkon 🇰🇪
Kenyan high school student from Moi's Bridge, building AI to help farmers with just a phone.

### 🎯 Mission
Build a phone-based model to detect maize diseases (MSV & MLN) early for smallholder farmers in Rift Valley.

### 🔧 What I'm Building
- Collecting maize leaf images around Moi's Bridge
- Training model with Teachable Machine + Colab
- Goal: 90%+ accuracy, works offline on phone

### 🛠️ Tools
- Phone, GitHub, Python, TensorFlow, Colab

### 📍 About Me
- Location: Moi's Bridge, Kenya
- Goal: Learn AI, apply to agriculture, aim for MIT EECS
- Contact: github.com/abraham4obuya-ux

> "Building with what I have — just a phone and data."